\label{lemma8}
		Suppose Assumption \ref{assum1} holds. Denote $\mathcal{L}_s = \frac{\gamma_s}{\alpha_s}+(T_s-1)\frac{\gamma_s(\alpha_s+p_s)}{\alpha_s}, \mathcal{R}_s = \frac{\gamma_s}{\alpha_s}(1-\alpha_s)+(T_s-1)\frac{\gamma_sp_s}{\alpha_s}$. Set $\theta_t =\begin{cases}
