\label{theorem2c}
		Suppose Assumption \ref{assum2} holds. Denote $s_0=\lfloor\log n\rfloor+1$. Suppose $s> s_0$, set $\{T_s\}, \{p_s\}, \{\eta_{s,t}\}, \{\theta_t\}$ as \[T_s = T_{s_0} = 2^{s_0-1}, \; p_s = \frac{1}{2}, \; \eta_{s,t}=\frac{\left(\frac{1}{\Gamma_{T_{s_0}}}\right)^{s-s_0-1}D_0}{snL}, \; \theta_t=\begin{cases}
