		&+\sum_{t=1}^{T_s}\Gamma_{t-1}\frac{\gamma_s\mu^2L^2d}{\tau}+\sum_{t=1}^{T_s}\Gamma_{t-1}\frac{\gamma_s}{\alpha_s}\cdot\frac{3\mu^2Ld}{2}\\
